@prefix gd: <https://gurudevi.lk/ontology/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix gufo: <http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#> .
<https://gurudevi.lk/axioms> a owl:Ontology .
gd:Person owl:disjointWith gd:Institution .
gd:Person rdfs:subClassOf gufo:FunctionalComplex . gd:Institution rdfs:subClassOf gufo:FunctionalComplex .
gd:Bond rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Relator . gd:Authority rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Relator .
gufo:Relator owl:disjointWith gufo:FunctionalComplex .
